<title>UK: Scottish Life unit sets 125 mln stg perpetual bond.</title>
<headline>Scottish Life unit sets 125 mln stg perpetual bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by sole lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SCOTTISH LIFE FINANCE PLC</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  SCOTTISH LIFE ASSURANCE CO</p>
<p> AMT    125 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY  * PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE   PERPETUAL     ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    28.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+135 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    * CALL ON 28.NOV.06 WHEN COUPON STEPS UP</p>
<p>	   ** TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA1	LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A-	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING 7.5 PERCENT 2006 GILT.</p>
<p> NOTES	SUBORDINATED.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
